8.jpg","share":0.154375},{"title":"Green Dome 2 - Kerman, Iran","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Green_Dome_2_-_Kerman%2C_Iran.jpg/500px-Green_Dome_2_-_Kerman%2C_Iran.jpg","ratio":0.75,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Green_Dome_2_-_Kerman,_Iran.jpg","share":0.1425}]}}